        138.3654022216797,
        639.7559204101562
      ],
      "text": "TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        647.44873046875,
        509.43536376953125,
        660.8002319335938
      ],
      "text": "Current WHO guidelines do not recommend preventive therapy for contacts of DR-TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        663.4452514648438,
        509.4700927734375,
        676.7967529296875
      ],
      "text": "patients. No clinical trials have been done to inform policy, but observational studies",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        679.4417114257812,
        509.49298095703125,
        692.793212890625
      ],
      "text": "have been reported. The management of contacts of DR-TB cases, whether the contacts",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        695.438232421875,
        342.984375,
        708.7897338867188
      ],
      "text": "are children or adults, is an important research topic.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        719.9447631835938,
        509.43548583984375,
        733.2962646484375
      ],
      "text": "Close contacts of DR-TB patients who develop TB disease usually have drug-resistant",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        735.9412231445312,
        126.57740020751953,
        749.292724609375
      ],
      "text": "disease.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        760.44775390625,
        509.40093994140625,
        773.7992553710938
      ],
      "text": "All children with an infectious TB contact should be screened for TB disease, especially",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
